253
00:13:05,209 --> 00:13:07,825
Kita tabur garam pada tembikai.

254
00:13:07,848 --> 00:13:09,082
Eh?

255
00:13:09,106 --> 00:13:12,883
Tabur garam pada tembikai?

256
00:13:12,906 --> 00:13:16,597
Tembikai kan manis.

257
00:13:16,620 --> 00:13:19,587
Kenapa nak tabur garam?

258
00:13:19,610 --> 00:13:24,108
Sebab garam buat ia lebih manis.

259
00:13:24,131 --> 00:13:26,064
Betul ke?

260
00:13:26,087 --> 00:13:28,287
Tak boleh percaya!

261
00:13:28,310 --> 00:13:32,244
Cuba saja, takkan tipu pun.

262
00:13:32,267 --> 00:13:34,200
Baiklah.

263
00:13:34,223 --> 00:13:37,068
Saya tabur sikit saja.

264
00:13:37,092 --> 00:13:39,063
Rasanya macam mana?

265
00:13:39,086 --> 00:13:42,623
Wah, betul juga!

266
00:13:42,646 --> 00:13:45,653
Jadi lebih manis!

267
00:13:45,677 --> 00:13:49,210
Ajaib tapi sedap!

268
00:13:49,233 --> 00:13:52,000
Baguslah suka.

269
00:13:52,023 --> 00:13:54,556
Makan banyak-banyak ya.

270
00:13:54,579 --> 00:13:56,312
Baiklah,

271
00:13:56,335 --> 00:14:00,902
Budaya Jepun sangat menarik, bukan?

272
00:14:00,925 --> 00:14:02,425
Adegan 7: Jelajah Retro & Cara Minum Ramune / Jelajah Retro dan Cara Menikmati Ramune

273
00:14:02,425 --> 00:14:07,239
Hari ini kita datang ke tempat pelancongan yang retro.

274
00:14:07,263 --> 00:14:10,130
Ada kedai jajan tradisional!

275
00:14:10,153 --> 00:14:11,953
Mari masuk.

276
00:14:11,976 --> 00:14:15,670
Eh, ada ramune sejuk dijual.

277
00:14:15,693 --> 00:14:17,826
Ramune?

278
00:14:17,849 --> 00:14:21,226
Botol kacanya cantik ya.

279
00:14:21,250 --> 00:14:22,984
Beli lah.

280
00:14:23,007 --> 00:14:25,092
Nih, silakan.

281
00:14:25,116 --> 00:14:26,849
Terima kasih.

282
00:14:26,872 --> 00:14:30,719
Tapi, macam mana nak minum ni?

283
00:14:30,742 --> 00:14:33,709
Takde penutup pulak.

284
00:14:33,732 --> 00:14:37,732
Tekan penutup plastik tu.

285
00:14:37,755 --> 00:14:39,688
Ini ke?

286
00:14:39,711 --> 00:14:44,121
Wah, ada guli masuk dalam!

287
00:14:44,145 --> 00:14:45,982
Betul tu.

288
00:14:46,005 --> 00:14:50,491
Bila guli tu masuk, baru boleh minum.

289
00:14:50,515 --> 00:14:53,248
Mekanismenya menarik betul!

290
00:14:53,271 --> 00:14:56,604
Jom, kita makan.

291
00:14:56,627 --> 00:15:00,227
Eh, jus tak keluar pulak.

292
00:15:00,250 --> 00:15:03,926
Dah condongkan botol banyak-banyak?

293
00:15:03,950 --> 00:15:07,483
Dah condong banyak-banyak.

294
00:15:07,506 --> 00:15:09,959
Tapi tak keluar jugak.

295
00:15:09,983 --> 00:15:15,881
Oh, guli tu tersumbat di mulut botol.

296
00:15:15,904 --> 00:15:19,870
Betul juga, tersumbat tu.

297
00:15:19,893 --> 00:15:22,227
Macam mana nak buat ni?

298
00:15:22,250 --> 00:15:27,666
Ada bahagian yang sedikit cekung dekat mulut botol tu.

299
00:15:27,689 --> 00:15:30,456
Bahagian yang cekung?

300
00:15:30,479 --> 00:15:33,045
Oh, ini ke?

301
00:15:33,068 --> 00:15:36,526
Gantungkan guli tu di situ.

302
00:15:36,550 --> 00:15:38,283
Oh, begitu.

303
00:15:38,306 --> 00:15:41,515
Aku cuba tahan guli tu kat situ.

304
00:15:41,539 --> 00:15:45,139
Kalau begitu, guli takkan jatuh.

305
00:15:45,162 --> 00:15:47,815
Aku cuba dulu.

306
00:15:47,838 --> 00:15:50,604
Wah, keluar dah!

307
00:15:50,627 --> 00:15:52,903
Boleh minum?

308
00:15:52,927 --> 00:15:55,261
Syukurlah.

309
00:15:55,284 --> 00:16:00,140
Ya, minuman berkarbonat ini sangat sedap!

310
00:16:00,163 --> 00:16:05,097
Tapi, minumnya agak susah juga.

311
00:16:05,121 --> 00:16:07,773
Perlu teknik sikit.

312
00:16:07,796 --> 00:16:10,964
Biasa nanti senang lah.

313
00:16:10,988 --> 00:16:15,521
Bunyi guli bergolek tu merdu betul.

314
00:16:15,544 --> 00:16:18,559
Bunyi musim panas ni.

315
00:16:18,583 --> 00:16:23,616
Ya, terasa musim panas Jepun.

316
00:16:23,639 --> 00:16:26,093
Nak beli lagi satu?

317
00:16:26,117 --> 00:16:28,127
Baguslah tu.

318
00:16:28,151 --> 00:16:31,951
Lepas ni aku boleh minum dengan lebih baik.

319
00:16:31,974 --> 00:16:33,474
Adegan 8: Makan Hamo Musim Panas di Kawadoko / Makan Hamo Musim Panas di Kawadoko

320
00:16:33,474 --> 00:16:37,725
Musim panas di Kyoto sangat panas, ya.

321
00:16:37,748 --> 00:16:39,882
Memanglah.

322
00:16:39,905 --> 00:16:43,842
Tapi di sini sejuk.

323
00:16:43,865 --> 00:16:48,799
Ya, ada kedai di atas sungai.

324
00:16:48,822 --> 00:16:52,756
Ini dipanggil kawadoko.

325
00:16:52,779 --> 00:16:57,272
Boleh nampak air sungai, cantik sangat.

326
00:16:57,296 --> 00:17:00,496
Anginnya sedap betul, ya.

327
00:17:00,518 --> 00:17:04,328
Nah, makanan sudah datang.

328
00:17:04,352 --> 00:17:07,685
Ikan putih yang cantik, ya.

329
00:17:07,708 --> 00:17:10,042
Apakah ini?

330
00:17:10,065 --> 00:17:14,031
Ini ikan yang dipanggil 'hamo'.

331
00:17:14,054 --> 00:17:17,621
Ikan mewah untuk musim panas.

332
00:17:17,644 --> 00:17:19,244
Hamo?

333
00:17:19,267 --> 00:17:22,000
Baru pertama kali dengar.

334
00:17:22,023 --> 00:17:26,657
Disebut 'yubiki', iaitu telah dicelup dalam air panas.

335
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:30,046
Sapu sos plum dan makanlah.

336
00:17:30,069 --> 00:17:32,313
Nampak sedapnya.

337
00:17:32,337 --> 00:17:34,138
Jom makan.

338
00:17:34,162 --> 00:17:39,295
Eh, ikan ini tiada tulang ke?

339
00:17:39,318 --> 00:17:43,751
Tidak, sebenarnya banyak tulang.

340
00:17:43,774 --> 00:17:48,647
Eh, banyak tulang?

341
00:17:48,671 --> 00:17:50,071
Baiklah!

342
00:17:50,094 --> 00:17:53,694
Tapi tak mengapa.

343
00:17:53,717 --> 00:17:59,484
Tukang masak telah memotong tulangnya dengan pisau halus.

344
00:17:59,507 --> 00:18:02,313
Memotong tulang?

345
00:18:02,336 --> 00:18:03,993
Baiklah!

346
00:18:04,016 --> 00:18:08,550
Itu teknik istimewa yang dipanggil 'bone cutting'.

347
00:18:08,573 --> 00:18:13,706
Jadi, walaupun ada tulang, boleh dimakan begitu sahaja.

348
00:18:13,729 --> 00:18:16,496
Teknik yang hebat!

349
00:18:16,518 --> 00:18:19,165
Baiklah, saya makan sekarang.

350
00:18:19,189 --> 00:18:23,859
Wah, sangat lembut!

351
00:18:23,883 --> 00:18:27,250
Tulangnya langsung tak terasa.

352
00:18:27,273 --> 00:18:29,113
Syukurlah.

353
00:18:29,136 --> 00:18:32,469
Sos plum sangat sesuai dengannya.

354
00:18:32,492 --> 00:18:34,026
Baiklah!

355
00:18:34,048 --> 00:18:38,382
Segar dan sangat sedap!

356
00:18:38,405 --> 00:18:41,571
Ikan yang sempurna untuk musim panas.

357
00:18:41,594 --> 00:18:46,330
Saya dapat mengenali budaya Kyoto yang hebat.

358
00:18:46,354 --> 00:18:51,187
Pemandangannya indah dan makanannya juga sedap.

359
00:18:51,210 --> 00:18:54,879
Terima kasih kerana membawa saya ke sini.

360
00:18:54,902 --> 00:19:00,469
Tidak mengapa, masih banyak lagi makanan sedap.

361
00:19:00,492 --> 00:19:02,459
Tidak sabar nak cuba!

362
00:19:02,482 --> 00:19:05,316
Mari makan perlahan-lahan.

363
00:19:05,339 --> 00:19:06,839
Senario 9: Pertemuan Tak Terduga di Kafe

364
00:19:06,839 --> 00:19:11,639
Kita sudah berjalan jauh dalam cuaca panas ini.

365
00:19:11,662 --> 00:19:15,906
Ya, tekak saya sangat haus.

366
00:19:15,930 --> 00:19:19,063
Mari masuk ke restoran ini.

367
00:19:19,086 --> 00:19:21,102
Baguslah tu.

368
00:19:21,126 --> 00:19:23,340
Sejuknya di sini.

369
00:19:23,363 --> 00:19:26,763
Oh, teh sudah datang.

370
00:19:26,786 --> 00:19:31,052
Wah, minuman sejuk!

371
00:19:31,075 --> 00:19:34,209
Warnanya perang.

372
00:19:34,232 --> 00:19:39,466
Nasib baik, dapat ais kopi percuma!

373
00:19:39,489 --> 00:19:43,059
Eh, ais kopi?

374
00:19:43,083 --> 00:19:49,416
Ya, di negara saya, warna ini bermaksud kopi.

375
00:19:49,439 --> 00:19:51,773
Saya minum dulu~

376
00:19:51,796 --> 00:19:55,196
Glek-glek.

377
00:19:55,219 --> 00:19:56,425
Eh?

378
00:19:56,449 --> 00:19:59,908
Rasanya sangat berbeza!

379
00:19:59,931 --> 00:20:02,131
Tidak pahit ke?

380
00:20:02,154 --> 00:20:04,355
Tidak manis ke?

381
00:20:04,378 --> 00:20:09,391
Ya, tidak pahit dan tidak manis.

382
00:20:09,415 --> 00:20:12,262
Ini bukan kopi, tau.

383
00:20:12,285 --> 00:20:15,918
Ini teh barli yang dipanggil 'mugicha'.

384
00:20:15,941 --> 00:20:20,708
Di kedai makan Jepun, ini sering dihidangkan pada musim panas.

385
00:20:20,731 --> 00:20:23,664
Anda boleh minum secara percuma.

386
00:20:23,687 --> 00:20:27,257
Sangat gembira kerana ia percuma.

387
00:20:27,281 --> 00:20:29,287
Teh barli?

388
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:32,110
Saya minum ini buat pertama kali.

389
00:20:32,133 --> 00:20:35,975
Rasanya segar dan melegakan tekak.

390
00:20:35,998 --> 00:20:40,198
Tidak mengandungi kafein, jadi baik untuk kesihatan.

391
00:20:40,221 --> 00:20:42,622
Begitu ya.

392
00:20:42,645 --> 00:20:45,979
Sangat mudah diminum.

393
00:20:46,002 --> 00:20:51,301
Saya mahu minum ais kopi, tapi ini pun sedap.

394
00:20:51,324 --> 00:20:53,757
Suka tak?

395
00:20:53,780 --> 00:20:55,747
Baguslah.

396
00:20:55,770 --> 00:21:00,570
Banyak ais, jadi sangat sejuk.

397
00:21:00,593 --> 00:21:04,593
Maaf, boleh minta tambah?

398
00:21:04,616 --> 00:21:07,470
Minumlah banyak-banyak.

399
00:21:07,493 --> 00:21:08,826
Baiklah!

400
00:21:08,849 --> 00:21:13,493
Pada musim panas Jepun, teh barli memang diperlukan.

401
00:21:13,516 --> 00:21:16,749
Ayuh, buat pesanan.

402
00:21:16,772 --> 00:21:19,106
Apa yang nak dimakan?

403
00:21:19,129 --> 00:21:22,411
Saya nak makan udon sejuk.

404
00:21:22,434 --> 00:21:23,934
Senario 10: Kari Pedas pada Hari Terik / Kari Pedas di Hari yang Sangat Panas

405
00:21:23,934 --> 00:21:29,074
Hari ini memang hari yang sangat panas.

406
00:21:29,097 --> 00:21:33,830
Matahari terik sangat, rasanya nak cair saja.

407
00:21:33,853 --> 00:21:37,747
Pada hari sebegini, mari kita pergi ke kedai ini.

408
00:21:37,771 --> 00:21:40,138
Kedai kari?

409
00:21:40,161 --> 00:21:43,197
Wangi sangat!

410
00:21:43,221 --> 00:21:48,089
Ya, kari pedas di sini terkenal.

411
00:21:48,112 --> 00:21:51,245
Eh, pedas sangat ke?

412
00:21:51,268 --> 00:21:54,035
Kari ini merah menyala ya.

413
00:21:54,058 --> 00:21:57,946
Ya, sangat pedas.

414
00:21:57,970 --> 00:22:00,349
Tunggu dulu.

415
00:22:00,373 --> 00:22:04,307
Hari yang panas begini.

416
00:22:04,330 --> 00:22:08,530
Kenapa makan makanan panas dan pedas?

417
00:22:08,553 --> 00:22:11,529
Akan jadi lebih panas lagi.

418
00:22:11,552 --> 00:22:16,430
Makan makanan pedas akan membuat kita banyak berpeluh.

419
00:22:16,454 --> 00:22:22,221
Apabila berpeluh, badan akan terasa sejuk selepas itu.

420
00:22:22,244 --> 00:22:27,584
Di Jepun, ramai yang makan makanan pedas pada musim panas.

421
00:22:27,607 --> 00:22:30,376
Bertenaga juga.

422
00:22:30,399 --> 00:22:32,566
Betul ke?

423
00:22:32,589 --> 00:22:35,122
Macam tak percaya je.

424
00:22:35,145 --> 00:22:37,745
Tapi, saya faham.

425
00:22:37,768 --> 00:22:39,972
Saya nak cuba.

426
00:22:39,996 --> 00:22:42,573
Kari dah sampai!

427
00:22:42,596 --> 00:22:44,396
Silakan.

428
00:22:44,419 --> 00:22:49,352
Wah, bau saja dah buat berpeluh!

429
00:22:49,375 --> 00:22:51,508
Jom makan.

430
00:22:51,531 --> 00:22:55,098
P-pedas sangat!

431
00:22:55,121 --> 00:22:57,354
Silakan minum air.

432
00:22:57,377 --> 00:22:59,990
A-awak okay tak?

433
00:23:00,014 --> 00:23:03,814
Minum air pun masih pedas.

434
00:23:03,837 --> 00:23:06,837
Mulut saya sakit!

435
00:23:06,860 --> 00:23:10,661
Tapi, sudu tak berhenti.

436
00:23:10,684 --> 00:23:12,451
Baiklah!

437
00:23:12,474 --> 00:23:15,074
Pedasnya!

438
00:23:15,097 --> 00:23:19,064
Tapi, sangat sedap.

439
00:23:19,087 --> 00:23:22,253
Memang ada rasa umami.

440
00:23:22,276 --> 00:23:25,876
Peluh mengalir deras dari dahi.

441
00:23:25,899 --> 00:23:28,466
Seronoknya, kan?

442
00:23:28,489 --> 00:23:30,226
Ya.

443
00:23:30,250 --> 00:23:34,135
Anehnya, rasa macam dah segar sikit.

444
00:23:34,159 --> 00:23:39,434
Lihatlah, bila keluar dari kedai ni, rasa sejuk sikit.

445
00:23:39,457 --> 00:23:41,702
Memanglah.

446
00:23:41,726 --> 00:23:45,328
Rasa tak sepanas tadi.

447
00:23:45,351 --> 00:23:49,370
Kari pedas musim panas ni memang best!

448
00:23:49,394 --> 00:23:51,401
Baiklah!

449
00:23:51,424 --> 00:23:54,791
Boleh jadi ketagih ni.

450
00:23:54,814 --> 00:23:57,092
Jom datang lagi!